    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Subterranean Assault",
    "summary": "Attacks by **TYRANIDS** models in your army re-roll **[Hit rolls](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls)** of 1.\n\nTunnel Markers work as follows:\n\n- When a **BURROWER** unit of yours arrives from Reserves, put a 40mm round Tunnel Marker anywhere more than 3\" horizontally from every enemy unit and within 1\" of that **BURROWER** unit.\n- During your [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase)'s Reinforcements step, a unit you set up from Reserves may instead go more than 6\" horizontally from every enemy unit, wholly within 9\" of a Tunnel Marker of yours.\n- An enemy model (not **AIRCRAFT**) that ends any move within 3\" of a Tunnel Marker of yours removes that marker.",
